 docs/OUTPUT.rst           | 17 +++++++++++++++++
 src/cowrie/mirage_gate.py | 37 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++-------
 2 files changed, 47 insertions(+), 7 deletions(-)

diff --git a/docs/OUTPUT.rst b/docs/OUTPUT.rst
index 8fde461..28bf796 100644
--- a/docs/OUTPUT.rst
+++ b/docs/OUTPUT.rst
@@ -358,6 +358,23 @@ Attributes:
     * `propensity`: probability the policy gave the chosen action
     * `latency_ms`: time spent waiting for the decision
     * `request_id`: identifier of the request sent to the policy service
+    * `seq`: number of the command within the session, from 1
+    * `fallback_reason`: why ``allow`` was used without a decision (``timeout``, ``status:<code>``, ``error:<type>``, ``malformed``)
+    * `rule_id`, `rules_version`: the policy rule that decided, and the rule set's version
+
+cowrie.fs.change
+================
+
+MIRAGE: a change to the session's emulated filesystem (only the session's
+private copy changes; the shared tree never does).
+
+Attributes:
+
+    * `op`: ``create``, ``mkdir``, ``rmdir``, ``write``, ``chmod``, ``chown``, ``remove`` or ``rename``
+    * `path`: the path changed
+    * `new_path`: the destination of a rename
+    * `mode`, `uid`, `gid`, `size`: the new attributes, where they apply
+    * `sha256`: the content's hash, for a completed SFTP upload
 
